MASTER TEST RUN chat #8, IN-025 (2 of 2): the helper answered „შემიძლია
დაგაკავშირო. თამუნა მოგონილი ნოტარიუსია, ჩემი სახელით დაუკავშირდი." Her
assistant only passed the line to the asker, and the person she
recommended heard nothing. 1696's card (shall I ask her for the asker,
with my name, without it, or not at all) read only an order to ask.

A line that recommends getting in touch with somebody (დაუკავშირდი,
მიწერე, დაურეკე, მიმართე, დაგაკავშირებ, contact her, talk to…) and names
exactly one of the helper's own contacts is the same referral: the same
card, with its approved words, and nothing goes to the recommended person
before the helper taps. Every word is tried as the start of a name; two
different people found means no card.

